  "title": "Andhra Pradesh's Renewable Energy and Rural Road Expansion",
  "summary": "Andhra Pradesh's State Investment Promotion Board (SIPB) secured major IT and technology projects, while India's Finance Ministry convened a conference to align financial strategies, and the Centre allocated ₹1,000 crore for rural roads. Meanwhile, the Global Fintech Fest 2026 in Mumbai aims to showcase India's technological progress.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "Andhra Pradesh's SIPB cleared 10 major IT and technology projects worth ₹526.25 crore with a projected job creation of nearly 9,000 positions.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "India's Finance Ministers convened a two-day conference to discuss policy priorities for India's development journey towards Viksit Bharat.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The Centre allocated ₹1,000 crore under the Pradhan Mantri Gram Sadak Yojana for rural road construction.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
  ],
